==Restriction==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] Units

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Confessional Tree (Enemy Base)|Confessional Tree]].
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Stall and stack [[Class Rep Cat (Special Cat)|Class Rep Cat]] on the Doge Darks. Those will help, as [[Tomboy Lion Cat (Special Cat)|Tomboy Lion Cat]] can't outrange the Gory Dark and will likely die quick depending on your level. If you're still struggling, bring a Sniper the Cat and switch to normal Cat Cannon.

